<p>South African authorities say at least two of their citizens have died in Ukraine while fighting for Russia, and they say some were lured abroad through a recruitment scheme. In a related development, South Africa said 15 men who said they were duped into joining the war have returned home after President Cyril Ramaphosa secured an agreement with Russian President Vladimir Putin for their return. In Kenya, prosecutors charged a man with trafficking after authorities alleged he deceived young Kenyans and helped arrange their travel to fight for Russia in Ukraine.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/F1cjg-lzj0K3jZGI3m_p0n3mc6zVCkzKqWSE0grTwR0IXoBBfH42Jf7HF3oNWPvqZYmQFrpOgdZKXGFhwXHWHGRbdCu10L3hgDTFo-P5jBpo6psDMz82hot1rgzSLDzWNNoZcfza9CDStx6DN9QQzjE-iVRmypexl5s3HKx1x6IMDLfNam5Zvfi20iXixGxymu1EYDLy_uwF1aU6kB6crQ' alt='South African men who said they had been duped into fighting for Russia after arriving in Durban, South Africa, on Wednesday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Reported scale: Kenyan officials and BBC-cited reporting say about 1,000 Kenyans have reportedly been recruited to fight for Russia.</li><li>Accused recruiter’s role: Reporting links the suspect to a recruitment agency and says he deceived job seekers, then facilitated their travel as part of the alleged scheme.</li><li>Case specifics: A Nairobi court case alleged the trafficking of 25 Kenyans connected to recruitment to fight for Russia.</li><li>South Africa investigation: South Africa’s foreign ministry said the deaths were tied to people being tricked by a recruitment scheme, and said authorities are investigating.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>South African government: Officials said at least two South Africans died fighting for Russia in Ukraine, and linked the deaths to people being tricked by a recruitment scheme. (<a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/2-south-africans-died-fighting-russia-ukraine-south-130529464'>ABC News</a>)</li><li>South African presidency: President Cyril Ramaphosa said 15 men who said they were duped into fighting for Russia returned home after he secured an agreement with Vladimir Putin. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/26/world/africa/russia-ukraine-south-africa-fighters.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>Kenya prosecutors: Kenya’s director of public prosecutions said the suspect was charged in a case alleging human trafficking linked to recruitment to fight for Russia. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/26/kenyan-man-charged-with-duping-people-to-fight-for-russia-in-ukraine-war'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>BBC reporting: The BBC cited reporting that about 1,000 Kenyans have reportedly been recruited to fight for Russia, framing the Nairobi case within broader concerns about young men being lured abroad for the war effort. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cx2g79kpe2po'>BBC News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/26/world/africa/russia-ukraine-south-africa-fighters.html'>15 South Africans Duped Into Fighting for Russia in Ukraine Return Home</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/kenyan-court-charges-man-with-recruiting-people-to-fight-for-russia'>S.Africa deaths, Kenya court case show citizens drawn into Ukraine war</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/2-south-africans-died-fighting-russia-ukraine-south-130529464'>At least 2 South Africans died fighting for Russia in Ukraine, South Africa says</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/kenya-russia-ukraine-war-human-trafficking-hundreds-to-fight-for-putin/'>Man charged with trafficking young Kenyans to fight for Russia in Ukraine</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cx2g79kpe2po'>Kenyan charged with luring young men to fight for Russia in Ukraine</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/26/kenyan-man-charged